entries[76357] = { ["name"] = "Handwraps of Dying Light", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nHands Cloth\n2 Armor\n+2 Intellect\n+5 Stamina\n+ 1 Critical Strike\n+ 3 Versatility\n\nPrismatic Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 1 Intellect\n\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Priest\nVestments of Dying Light (0/5)\nHandwraps of Dying Light\nCowl of Dying Light\nLegwraps of Dying Light\nRobes of Dying Light\nMantle of Dying Light\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set : After using Power Word: Barrier or Divine Hymn, the mana cost of your healing spells is reduced by 25% for [ Power Infusion : 10 sec / 23 sec].\n(4) Set : Your Power Word: Shield has a 10% chance to absorb 100% additional damage, and the duration of your Holy Word abilities is increased by 33%.\nSell Price:" }
